            text: _("My lord Kalenz, you are in great danger! You must leave here immediately."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("What?!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Landar has seized control of the army. He has eliminated the Council and proclaimed himself High Warlord of the Elves. What is worse, there is word out that he has already ordered your assassination."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Too late! All traitors will die!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Listen to me! We have fought and bled side by side. We must trust in each other and face the orcs together!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Do not listen to this traitor! You have all heard the order!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("You should try to reach Uradredia and the North Elves. He too, has refused to join Landar. Word is that some troops still loyal to you are heading there."),
          },
